{"unit_id":"Eason-22__dsh-autorestart#card-zh","repo":"Eason-22/dsh-autorestart","commit":"533e97027eb5be29e54a1afa5f0d7c9694350a05","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-autorestart 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的重启与恢复插件。它注册 agent 工具，在所有会话空闲并经过安静窗口后安排重启，并通过持久检查点在启动后恢复中断会话和目标。它还提供状态查看与取消操作、浏览器中的待重启提示、重启前配置快照，以及等待会话结束后倒计时关机。适合需要更新后重启 DSH、同时希望继续未完成工作的使用场景。无需额外 API 密钥；快照和检查点保存在本机。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:8358-8375","index.js:8496-8508","client.js:1-16","lib/backup.js:2484-2525","lib/sleep.js:1-20"]}
{"unit_id":"Eason-22__dsh-autorestart#card-en","repo":"Eason-22/dsh-autorestart","commit":"533e97027eb5be29e54a1afa5f0d7c9694350a05","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-autorestart waits until DSH conversations are idle before restarting, then resumes interrupted sessions from checkpoints. Agent tools manage restart requests and the web client shows pending status. It can save local configuration snapshots and offers countdown shutdown. No API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:8358-8375","index.js:8496-8508","client.js:1-16","lib/backup.js:2484-2525","lib/sleep.js:1-20"]}
